Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:04.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈 过得还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:06.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,工作忙不忙？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:10.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我这边每天都过得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}《小空公主日记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}今天小公主也很精神
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.17,0:00:14.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我又交到了新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:18.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼弟弟是个很努力的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都一步一步 向着自己的梦想努力前行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:28.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,还有小晴也和我们一起...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:33.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼和小晴都好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.89,0:00:38.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是... 我就...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}唔唔唔！回忆中的点心是什么味道的!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:20.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？欢迎派对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.21,0:02:29.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我想办一场迎接新Precure的阿翼 以及共勉将来的派对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:32.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？为了我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:37.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！阿翼 你就在边上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:40.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,还是有点不适应呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:44.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么说呢 不用为了我这么费心...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.71,0:02:46.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都不费心！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:49.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想要办！这个欢迎派对！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.05,0:02:50.88,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:53.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空好像也赞成呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:56.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 不喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:02:58.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:00.69,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:05.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没有不喜欢... 很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:08.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就定下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:09.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:11.51,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:13.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,马上开始着手准备吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:15.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:17.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,-诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:17.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.62,0:03:20.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是给阿翼办的欢迎派对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:22.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,都交给我们来弄吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.09,0:03:26.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 我很难杵着一点事情都不做
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:27.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉很对不住你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:32.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 就让阿翼也帮忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:36.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们听取一下阿翼的意见 着手准备
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:39.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,说不准就能办成一场最欢乐的派对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:41.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 有道理啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:43.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我们三个人一起做准备吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:45.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:45.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(692,977)}是！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:45.19,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(662,1060)}小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:52.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:52.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,-哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.91,0:03:58.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,装饰和布置差不多就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:00.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,接着就是吃的了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:03.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 你有什么想吃的东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.87,0:04:07.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,说到派对美食 当属烧鲷鱼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:09.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 烧鲷鱼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:14.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？烧鲷鱼？小晴你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:19.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得 是嘟嘟鸟族用来庆祝的一种美食
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:21.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,至于详细的 我也不太清楚...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.54,0:04:24.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,外层口感软软糯糯 里面则是甜蜜蜜的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:27.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:31.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一次吃 还是在来到这里时 再前不久的日子...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:35.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我的画作入选了大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸和妈妈很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:42.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天 大家一起品尝的烧鲷鱼...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:46.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,超级美味啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.65,0:04:50.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来 阿翼一直都留在这边世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:55.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我并不是思乡了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:59.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我有通过由由阿姨的幻镜平板和父母保持联络的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:04.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做做看吧 这个烧鲷鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:07.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？可...可是 要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道具体的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:13.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这个吗... 诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.69,0:05:16.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这时候不能放弃 来挑战吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:17.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,-诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:17.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,-诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:21.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“一旦下定决心 就要永不言弃”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:23.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“这才是英雄”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没错吧 阿翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:28.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:31.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,首先跟由由阿姨打听一下 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊！奶奶或许知道一二呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了 烧鲷鱼的食谱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:46.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,幻镜平板还有这种功能吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.51,0:05:47.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,而且！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:48.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,速度这么快
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成品是这个样子的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:56.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:59.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没错！这就是烧鲷鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:03.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 的确是鱼的外形呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.91,0:06:06.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是第一次看到这种食品！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 即使在蓝天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1140,970)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:11.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,也只是嘟嘟鸟族代代相传的特别美食
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.15,0:06:17.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 这是我们这边世界的鲷鱼烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:18.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:18.36,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,-诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:19.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烧鲷鱼和鲷鱼烧确实看起来挺像的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但食材使用的是蓝天大地产的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和鲷鱼烧的口感会有一点点不同吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.15,0:06:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饼皮要使用肉嘟嘟小麦粉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馅好像要用肉嘟嘟果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:41.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:46.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就用这边的食材来试做鲷鱼烧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:49.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼你来尝味道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:50.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:00.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 好香的味道！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.61,0:07:02.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（电子音）（设定时间 开始/停止键）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:06.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:08.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是鲷鱼烧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:12.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,样子看起来跟烧鲷鱼一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:14.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就剩口感了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.18,0:07:17.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 你尝尝看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.07,0:07:24.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（盯着...）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:26.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:27.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,（盯着...）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.89,0:07:29.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.34,0:07:31.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（盯着...）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:33.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:43.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:44.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:49.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:50.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:53.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,和烧鲷鱼一样的口味吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.65,0:07:56.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这... 这个嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:07:59.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还是有区别的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:05.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 已经很好吃了 足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:09.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 现在才要开始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:10.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:15.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼只要告诉我 与这个鲷鱼烧的口味有哪些不同
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:18.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,应该就能够做出烧鲷鱼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.61,0:08:20.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:23.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 我感觉...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:26.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,面皮的味道基本一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.62,0:08:28.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉里面的馅有点不同...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:32.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就换一种馅的食材 再试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:34.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我也来帮手！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.11,0:08:36.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我也来！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:37.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:20.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 阿翼 看看有没有跟烧鲷鱼同样味道的鲷鱼烧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:23.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我一个一个试吃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:35.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:39.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有跟烧鲷鱼相同口味的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:48.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉 并没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}咸焦糖 芝士 咖喱 红薯 山芋\N巧克力 南瓜 花生 豆沙 蛋黄酱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.09,0:09:53.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 全部都很好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:09:59.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 继续挑战吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:06.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,蜂蜜和蛋黄酱 橙子这种水果或许也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:07.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.99,0:10:09.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:11.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能想到的食材 全都买回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:14.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,时间也差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:17.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,希望能够顺利做出来...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:21.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不 一定能做出来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:22.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真白
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:29.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你和晴雯丽为了我 花费这么多精力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:33.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不用客气的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:38.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想让阿翼尝到烧鲷鱼 能够开心一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:42.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,想起来了 在我刚来到这里的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.27,0:10:48.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学想象了蓝天大地 做了云面包
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:51.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我可开心了...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:57.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学做的点心 有着让品尝过的人都露出笑容的神奇力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:10:59.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:02.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！没那么夸张的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.67,0:11:05.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不过... 要是真的话 那我还挺得意的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:09.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我之所以会开始做点心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.17,0:11:15.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是想给工作劳累的爸爸妈妈 做一份饭团
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.89,0:11:20.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,后来爸爸妈妈发现了我的小心思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:21.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我一起做了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:26.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那时候尝到的饭团 非常美味
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:30.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都笑了 是永生难忘的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.93,0:11:36.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定 就是在我心中类似于烧鲷鱼的味道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:37.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:40.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:41.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.19,0:11:44.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:50.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我其实不是想吃烧鲷鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:53.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我真正...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:57.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（烘山芋）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:57.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡~疤~烘~山~芋 烘山芋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:00.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,烘山芋！烘山芋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:04.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,烘山芋~烘山芋来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:17.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,快来买呀！甜甜的 热乎的 可好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:21.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:23.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你真正想吃的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.23,0:12:25.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那个啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:26.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:29.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没听见吗 美味的烘山芋来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:33.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在忙正事 你边上稍一稍！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:34.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:37.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不要理卡疤痛 我们继续
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.71,0:12:38.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:41.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,美味的烘山芋来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:42.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:44.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 能保持安静吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:48.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呸！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:52.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我这是假扮成卖石烤烘山芋的 好让你们掉以轻心的作战计划
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:53.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,一计不成！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:57.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那就来吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.21,0:13:07.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:11.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-能不能别捣乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:11.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,-别来捣乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.01,0:13:12.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
