Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.90,0:14:57.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,变身了呢 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.14,0:15:03.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 就用滚烫的烘山芋炮弹 把你们三个人一起给烘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:04.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:06.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:12.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:13.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:14.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:19.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:25.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,用力 用力 不许输！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:26.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,烘爆他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.97,0:15:28.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:32.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.53,0:15:34.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 强吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:37.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,继续射 把她射倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:39.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:40.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:43.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:47.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:50.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.83,0:15:52.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:55.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:58.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！Wing！你们好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:16:01.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,诶... 啊... 糟... 糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:03.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,到这个地步 吃了山芋...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:05.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我一记！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:10.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,臭死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:12.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:14.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.83,0:16:16.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在！动手 乱暴兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:18.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:19.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:21.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:28.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:35.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:38.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:38.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,-Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:44.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈！看看 看看 感觉怎么样？Precure小娃娃们！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:47.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就算人多起来 还是弱爆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:49.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,首先击破了一只！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.12,0:16:51.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,才没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:02.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我还能战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:03.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:03.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,-Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:05.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！战斗才开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:08.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只要齐心协力 一定能胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:10.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:17.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,又不会飞 身手也不灵活 一无是处的弱鸡杂鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:18.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,在说什么大话呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:23.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,-你说的不对！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:23.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-你说什么呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:27.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？我有哪儿说错了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.56,0:17:29.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,动手！乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:32.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:36.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism有着不逊色于任何人的温柔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:38.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:43.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism 一直在用她的温柔 照亮我的世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:46.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是我坚强的后盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:50.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,她为了我！做了烧鲷鱼...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:56.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了她 我才认识到真正重要的事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.31,0:18:01.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism她... 真白她！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,照亮了周遭的人们！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.97,0:18:08.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,-她有着光！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.97,0:18:08.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-她就是光！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing... Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:17.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:20.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们满嘴胡言 谁能听得懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:24.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这才叫做强啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:26.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.69,0:18:32.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我一发！超级巨大！烘山芋导弹！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.85,0:18:35.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,-Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.85,0:18:35.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:40.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·棱镜光流
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:40.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Prism Shot
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:48.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不会让你对我亲爱的朋友们出手的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.83,0:18:52.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,-Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.83,0:18:52.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:53.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什...什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:57.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上啊！乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:18:58.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.85,0:19:03.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄气阔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:06.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞翼冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:06.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wing Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:08.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱乱乱乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:09.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,机会来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:22.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空蓝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:22.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:26.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,棱镜白！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:26.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism White！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
